  "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->"456f039b-918d-e74b-b2f5-8b4af9da0f4e"],
 " ",
 "draws each array of the hypermatrix hm as cubes in space, in canonical \
order."
}], "Usage",ExpressionUUID->"6977b590-cec2-9e43-9790-87084a8e75e7"],

